<title>DENMARK: Danish FIH sets 400 mln Dkk 6.0 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish FIH sets 400 mln Dkk 6.0 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Tuesday by arranger Den Danske Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER: FINANSIERINGS INSTITUTET FOR INDUSTRI OG HAANDVAERK</p>
<p>A/S (FIH).</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 400 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>COUPON:SIX PERCENT. MATURITY: 5 MAY 2004.</p>
<p>ISS DATE: MARCH 10 1997 LUXEMBOURG STOCK EXCHANGE</p>
<p>ISS PRICE: 101.835 PERCENT.</p>
<p>MOODY:AA3</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
